- 3D Studio: replace placeholder box-sofa with proper 3D models built from
  geometry — cushioned sofa (2/3-seater, L-shape), bed (4 sizes with pillows
  and throw), curtains (wavy fabric, sheer/blackout/linen materials) and
  wall panels (3 moulding styles); 12 fabrics; studio lighting with soft
  shadows; drag-rotate and scroll-zoom
- Services section: add photography to all four service cards with hover
  zoom and lift, replacing the text-only grid
